(:taskCollection
  :id "Phase484RpcRecordStoreAndDeterministicDistribution"
  :createdAt 1789452000000
  :status "completed"
  :priorityOrder 1
  :summary "RPC-First Record Store, Attention Separation, Deterministic Serialization, and Event-Driven Memory Architecture"
  :phase "Phase484RpcRecordStoreAndDeterministicDistribution"
  :baseline "Audited 2026-09-13: All 11 monorepo record categories (tasks, decisions, receipts, plans, phases, telemetry, component docs, intents, notes, principles, recipes) rely on direct unvalidated filesystem writes to .asl/mem/, causing attention dispersal, race conditions, and syntax corruption."
